rxform
======

rxform is a Rust port of pyxform (https://github.com/XLSForm/pyxform), the
reference XLSForm to XForm converter written in Python and maintained by the
XLSForm community. The conversion rules, the question-type dictionary
(src/types.rs, ported from pyxform's question_type_dictionary.py) and the
output conventions follow pyxform, and part of the forms under tests/fixtures/
are copied from pyxform's test suite (see tests/fixtures/README.md). rxform's
output is validated against pyxform 4.5.0.

